
/*!
	add counter representing how many clients use an extension.

	unloading should happen per client close. the client loads, the counter goes up, the counter goes down on client close. if 0, unload.
*/

/*!
	implement a single malloc segment to "malloc" on.
*/

/*!
	max client amount?
